WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.577 --> 00:00:05.027
This is Sam's Tuesday.

2
00:00:05.457 --> 00:00:08.147
Some days, everything seems important.

3
00:00:08.637 --> 00:00:11.707
And deciding what to do first can feel like another task.

4
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:18.830
B.O.B. gives those thoughts somewhere to go, so they don't all have to stay in your head.

5
00:00:23.864 --> 00:00:26.134
Sam decides what each thing is.

6
00:00:26.604 --> 00:00:31.634
And when asked, B.O.B. suggests one next step, without taking the decision away.

7
00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:37.444
Nothing changes until Sam says so.

8
00:00:37.974 --> 00:00:42.484
Instead of handling everything at once, there's one useful next step.

9
00:00:45.926 --> 00:00:49.404
And when there's simply too much, the screen can get quieter:

10
00:00:49.454 --> 00:00:52.596
just the next step, and a place for new thoughts.

11
00:01:00.774 --> 00:01:04.344
Sam starts small, with one concrete first move.

12
00:01:04.874 --> 00:01:08.664
And before stepping away, Sam saves a place to come back to.

13
00:01:11.043 --> 00:01:13.793
Even after closing B.O.B., it's still there.

14
00:01:14.303 --> 00:01:16.453
The day isn't suddenly empty.

15
00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:20.833
But the next step is clearer, and the progress doesn't have to disappear.

16
00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:29.010
B.O.B. A little less noise. A clearer next step.

